  "id": "expectation",
  "term": "expectation",
  "definition": "Expectation is the belief that a future experience will have a particular character, grounded in past experience. In this historical account, it involves having in mind a connected train of ideas about what is coming and treating it as something that can be confirmed through further experience or action.",
